WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:07.590
I knew you would come here.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:09.384
Luculia.

00:00:10.301 --> 00:00:13.304
Why are you here
when the program is over now?

00:00:14.597 --> 00:00:17.767
Because I thought I could see you again
if I came here.

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:20.687
Tell me, Violet...

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:23.023
Who is the major?

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:30.530
You always ask at the end of your letters
if the major had sent a letter yet.

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:34.451
Isn't he the one you really
want to send a letter to?

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.912
Why don't we write a letter to him today?

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.623
Not like your usual reports,

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:43.668
but a letter with your true feelings.

00:00:46.087 --> 00:00:48.006
I won't leave until we're done.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:54.971
Major...

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:01.144
I'm sorry.

00:01:02.103 --> 00:01:07.817
I don't even know
what I want to say to him.

00:01:10.361 --> 00:01:13.531
Because I do not even understand
the meaning...

00:01:14.115 --> 00:01:15.658
of the words he told me.

00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:21.831
Violet, why did you want to become a Doll?

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:28.838
I... want to know what "I love you" means.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:32.842
You want to know what "I love you" means?

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:37.388
It's hard to communicate
your feelings, isn't it?

00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:43.561
The truth is, my parents died.

00:01:45.313 --> 00:01:46.856
The only family I have left...

00:01:47.398 --> 00:01:48.358
is my brother.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:53.780
I don't know what to say to him.

00:01:55.532 --> 00:01:56.908
When the war began,

00:01:57.534 --> 00:01:59.744
my brother got drafted.

00:02:00.703 --> 00:02:03.289
But there wasn't much fighting
in the Western Front

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.500
where he was deployed.

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:09.921
The fighting was always taking place
far away.

00:02:10.588 --> 00:02:14.425
So, the war didn't feel real to us.

00:02:16.594 --> 00:02:17.554
But...

00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:22.142
one day, when my parents
went to Herne for business,

00:02:22.725 --> 00:02:25.145
the Western Front was broken.

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:31.234
They couldn't find any trace
of my parents.

00:02:34.612 --> 00:02:36.156
And then the war ended.

00:02:38.241 --> 00:02:40.201
-My brother came home alive.
-Come on, give me one drink at least!

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:42.245
Give it a rest already!

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:45.206
I wanted to be happy
that at least he was alive.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:46.124
What the hell?

00:02:46.207 --> 00:02:48.084
-But...
-Shut up!

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:50.545
my brother was angry that he wasn't able
to protect Herne.

00:02:51.671 --> 00:02:53.464
He blames himself...

00:02:54.048 --> 00:02:55.842
for our parents' deaths.

00:03:00.763 --> 00:03:02.473
Don't show your face around here again.

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:09.689
I was just...

00:03:10.773 --> 00:03:11.816
I was just...

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.778
happy that he was alive.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:25.371
I just want to tell him "thank you."

